<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat October grain shipment figures (tonnes), followed by January-October totals (year-earlier in brackets).</p>
<p> Wheat	296,388   (76,651)     3,585,997  (6,086,724)</p>
<p> Maize	217,268  (190,754)     6,469,453  (5,760,678)</p>
<p> Sorghum     12,001   (14,881)	 660,556    (183,405)</p>
<p> Barley	   nil	(nil)	   6,888     (21,401)</p>
<p> Soybeans    38,242    (6,001)     2,114,240  (2,586,846)</p>
<p> Sunseed	  269	(nil)	 537,243    (824,389)</p>
<p> Others	25,849   (21,551)	 238,281    (221,636)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in October were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>WHEAT: Brazil 247,772; Kenya 18,501; Georgia 15,201</p>
<p>MAIZE: Brazil 63,653, Peru 37,992, United Kingdom 20,634, Cuba 16,601, Egypt 14,398, Germany 13,001.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
